        "stats": {
          "Detachment Points": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**VOWED TARGET**\n\nIn your Command phase, you can use this ability. If you do, select one **objective**. That **objective** is your **vowed objective** until your next Command phase.\n- Friendly **DEATHWING INFANTRY** unit’s attacks that target an enemy unit within range of your **vowed objective** have +1 to **wound rolls**.\n\n**Restrictions:** Your army can include **DARK ANGELS** units, but it cannot include any **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units drawn from any other Chapter."
      },
