      "Wargear§The Lion Helm": {
        "text": "Models in the bearer’s unit have a 4+ invulnerable save. In addition, once per battle, at any time, the bearer can summon a Watcher in the Dark. When it does, until the end of the phase, models in the bearer’s unit have the Feel No Pain 4+ ability against mortal wounds."
      },
      "Wargear§Watcher in the Dark": {
        "text": "Once per battle, at any time, this unit can summon a Watcher in the Dark. When it does, until the end of the phase, models in this unit have the Feel No Pain 4+ ability against mortal wounds.\n\n**Designer’s Note:** Place a Watcher in the Dark token next to the  unit, removing it when this ability has been used."
      },
