      "Ability§Chief Librarian (psyker level 3)": {
        "text": "**Engulfing Fear (psychic level 1):** In your Shooting phase, if this unit is not **battle-shocked**, you can make a **psychic roll** for this unit by rolling one D6. If you do:\n\n- On a 1, this unit is **battle-shocked**.\n- Select one enemy unit within 12” of this model. That unit makes a **battle-shock roll** with -1 to that **battle-shock roll**.\n\n**Whispers of the Shadow Forest (psychic level 1):** When an enemy unit targets this unit, if this unit is not **battle-shocked**, you can make a **psychic roll** for this unit by rolling one D6. If you do:\n- On a 1, this unit is **battle-shocked**.\n- Attacks that target this unit have -1 to **hit rolls** until the end of the phase."
      },
