      "Ability§Watcher in the Dark": {
        "text": "_Once per battle, per unit_\n\nIn any phase, when this unit suffers a mortal wound, this unit can summon a Watcher in the Dark. If it does, this unit has Feel No Pain 4+ against mortal wounds."
      },
      "Infantry/Mounted§Company Heroes": {
        "allowed": {
          "items": [
            "Character§Azrael",
            "Character§Lazarus"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Ability§Book of Salvation": {
        "text": "This unit’s melee attacks have +1 **A**."
      },
      "Ability§Whispers of the Shadow Forest": {
        "text": "_psychic level 1_\n\nWhen an enemy unit targets this unit, if this unit is not battle-shocked, you can make a **psychic roll** for this unit by rolling one D6. If you do:\n\n- On a 1, this unit is **battle-shocked**.\n\n- Attacks that target this unit have -1 to hit rolls until the end of the phase."
      },
      "Ability§The Watchers": {
        "text": "This unit has Feel No Pain 4+ against psychic attacks and mortal wounds."
      },
      "Ability§Master Strategist": {
        "text": "In your Command phase, you can use this ability. If you do, select one combat doctrine to be active for this unit until the start of your next Command phase, in addition to any other **combat doctrine**."
      },
      "Ability§Mist-wreathed Shadow Realms (Lion El’jonson)": {
        "text": "In your Command phase, if this unit is unengaged, you can use this ability. If you do:\n\n- Place this unit in strategic reserves.\n\n- This unit can make an ingress move in your next Movement phase (including in your first turn)."
      },
      "Ability§Martial Exemplar": {
        "text": "While a friendly Dark Angels unit is within 6\" of this unit, that unit’s melee attacks can:\n\n- Re-roll hit rolls of 1.\n\n- Re-roll wound rolls of 1."
      },
      "Ability§No Hiding from the Watchers": {
        "text": "While a friendly Dark Angels unit is within 6\" of this unit, that unit has Feel No Pain 5+ against psychic attacks and mortal wounds."
      },
      "Ability§Astartes Banner (Ravenwing Command Squad)": {
        "text": "While this unit contains a Ravenwing Ancient, this unit has +1 **OC**."
      },
      "Ability§Honour or Death (Ravenwing Command Squad)": {
        "text": "While this unit contains a Ravenwing Champion:\n\n- This unit has +1 to advance rolls and charge rolls.\n\n- When you target this unit with the Heroic Intervention **stratagem**, that use is -1CP."
      },
      "Ability§Narthecium (Ravenwing Command Squad)": {
        "text": "While this unit contains a Ravenwing Apothecary, in your Command phase, this unit heals D3+1 wounds."
      },
      "Ability§Emnity for the Unworthy": {
        "text": "This unit’s attacks that target a **CHARACTER** unit have +1 to hit rolls."
      }
    },
    "gameModes": {},
    "theme": {}
  }
